abstract: >-
  A protocol-construction and case-demonstration study examining whether the transformation history of research claims can remain reconstructable across human authorship, generative-model mediation, public contribution, correction, literature comparison, and versioned synthesis. The paper introduces PRCEP as a protocol candidate for preserving material claim transitions while explicitly separating provenance quality from truth or validation.
